---
const title = 'South Florida Cash Home Buyers | Blackburn Capital Partners';
const description = 'Sell your older home as it is. No repairs, no showings, no commissions. A local, family-owned buyer in Fort Lauderdale. Get a written cash offer and close on your timeline.';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light only" />
<title>{title}</title>
<meta name="description" content={description} />
<link rel="canonical" href="https://soflocashhomebuyers.com/" />
<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
<meta property="og:title" content={title} />
<meta property="og:description" content={description} />
<meta property="og:image" content="https://soflocashhomebuyers.com/images/jim-olga.webp" />
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Ccircle cx='32' cy='32' r='32' fill='%231F4D3A'/%3E%3Ctext x='32' y='44' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='36' text-anchor='middle' fill='%23F7F3EA'%3EB%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:ital,opsz,wght@0,8..60,400;0,8..60,600;1,8..60,400&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<script is:inline src="https://www.onefocuscrm.com/t.js" data-brand="blackburn-capital-partners" defer></script>
<style is:global>
html { color-scheme: light only !important; background: #F7F3EA !important; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body { margin: 0; background: #F7F3EA !important; color: #23302A !important; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { html, body { background: #F7F3EA !important; color: #23302A !important; } }
input { background: #FFFFFF !important; color: #23302A !important; }
a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #D9C28F; outline-offset: 2px; }
button[disabled] { opacity: 0.7; cursor: wait; }
@media (max-width: 720px) {
  h1 { font-size: 40px !important; }
  h2 { font-size: 32px !important; }
  nav a:not([href="#offer"]):not([href^="tel:"]) { display: none; }
  #top > div { padding-top: 48px !important; padding-bottom: 56px !important; }
  #offer { padding: 24px !important; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div style="width: 100%; background: #F7F3EA; color: #23302A; font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6">

<!-- HEADER -->
<header style="background: #FFFFFF; border-bottom: 1px solid #E4DCCB">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 18px 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px">
<a href="#top" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-decoration: none; color: #163828">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1F4D3A; color: #F7F3EA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600">B</span>
<span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.15">
<span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600">Blackburn Capital Partners</span>
<span style="font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5A665F">South Florida Cash Buyers</span>
</span>
</a>
<nav style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 28px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500">
<a href="#how" style="text-decoration: none; color: #23302A">How it works</a>
<a href="#buy" style="text-decoration: none; color: #23302A">Homes we buy</a>
<a href="#about" style="text-decoration: none; color: #23302A">About us</a>
<a href="#faq" style="text-decoration: none; color: #23302A">Questions</a>
<a href="tel:+19549931625" style="text-decoration: none; color: #1F4D3A; font-weight: 700">(954) 993-1625</a>
<a href="#offer" style="text-decoration: none; background: #1F4D3A; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600">Get my cash offer</a>
</nav>
</div>
</header>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="top" style="background: #1F4D3A; color: #F7F3EA">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 88px 24px 96px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: center">
<div style="flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0">
<div style="font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #D9C28F; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 20px">A local, family-owned home buyer</div>
<h1 style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 58px; line-height: 1.08; color: #FFFFFF">We buy older homes that need work. <span style="font-style: italic; color: #E7D3A6">For cash.</span></h1>
<p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 20px; color: #DCE6DF; max-width: 560px">We bring together the capital and the partners to buy your property as it is. No repairs, no cleaning, no showings and no agent commissions. You pick the closing date, and you deal with the same two people from the first call to the closing table.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px 28px; font-size: 16px; color: #F7F3EA">
<span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D9C28F" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg>Written offer, no obligation</span>
<span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D9C28F" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg>Close at a licensed title company</span>
<span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D9C28F" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg>Leave behind what you don't want</span>
</div>
</div>

<form id="offer" data-onefocus="cash-offer" style="flex: 1 1 380px; max-width: 460px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #23302A; border-radius: 10px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(10, 30, 20, 0.25); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<div>
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #163828">Get a fair cash offer</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5A665F">Tell us where the house is. We'll call you within one business day.</p>
</div>
<label style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Property address
<input type="text" name="property_address" required autocomplete="street-address" placeholder="Street, city, ZIP" style="height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; border: 1px solid #CFC6B3; border-radius: 6px; font: inherit; font-weight: 400; background: #FFFFFF; color: #23302A">
</label>
<label style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Your name
<input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="First and last name" style="height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; border: 1px solid #CFC6B3; border-radius: 6px; font: inherit; font-weight: 400; background: #FFFFFF; color: #23302A">
</label>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px">
<label style="flex: 1 1 160px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Phone
<input type="tel" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel" placeholder="(555) 555-0100" style="height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; border: 1px solid #CFC6B3; border-radius: 6px; font: inherit; font-weight: 400; background: #FFFFFF; color: #23302A">
</label>
<label style="flex: 1 1 160px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Email
<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" style="height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; border: 1px solid #CFC6B3; border-radius: 6px; font: inherit; font-weight: 400; background: #FFFFFF; color: #23302A">
</label>
</div>
<button type="submit" style="height: 54px; border: none; border-radius: 6px; background: #B4532A; color: #FFFFFF; font: inherit; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer">Get my cash offer</button>
<p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1F4D3A; text-align: center"></p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #5A665F">No obligation. We never sell or share your information. By submitting, you agree that Blackburn Capital Partners may call, text or email you about your property at the number and email above. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out.</p>
</form>
</div>
</section>

<!-- TRUST STRIP -->
<section style="background: #FFFFFF; border-bottom: 1px solid #E4DCCB">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 36px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 24px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #163828">Family owned</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: #5A665F">Jim and Olga Blackburn, Fort Lauderdale</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #163828">Close on your timeline</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: #5A665F">Soon, or months from now</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #163828">No commissions</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: #5A665F">We buy directly from you</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #163828">Any condition</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: #5A665F">Roof, plumbing, permits, clutter</span></div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section id="how" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 104px 24px 88px">
<div style="font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8A6A35; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px">How it works</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 48px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1.15; color: #163828; max-width: 720px">Three simple steps, and you stay in control the whole way.</h2>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 28px">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4DCCB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 40px; color: #1F4D3A">1</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #163828">Tell us about the house</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #4A564F">Fill in the short form or call us. A few questions about the home and your timing, nothing more.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4DCCB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 40px; color: #1F4D3A">2</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #163828">Walk through it with us</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #4A564F">We visit once, at a time that suits you. Then we give you a written cash offer and explain exactly how we got the number.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4DCCB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 40px; color: #1F4D3A">3</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #163828">Pick your closing date</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #4A564F">We close at a licensed title company. You receive your funds at closing by wire or check.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- HOMES WE BUY -->
<section id="buy" style="background: #EFE8D8">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px">
<div style="font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8A6A35; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px">Homes we buy</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1.15; color: #163828; max-width: 760px">If the house needs more than you want to put into it, we're a good fit.</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 44px; color: #4A564F; max-width: 680px">Most of the homes we buy are older and have been lived in for a long time. These are the situations we hear about most often.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 26px 28px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F4D3A" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex: none"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7"/><path d="M5 10v10h14V10"/><path d="M10 20v-6h4v6"/></svg><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 19px; color: #163828">Inherited a home</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4A564F">We work around probate and family timelines.</p></div></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 26px 28px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F4D3A" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex: none"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L3 18l3 3 6.3-6.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.5 2.5-2.4-.6-.6-2.4z"/></svg><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 19px; color: #163828">Needs major repairs</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4A564F">Roof, plumbing, electrical, foundation, water damage.</p></div></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 26px 28px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F4D3A" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex: none"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M2.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 13 0"/><path d="M17 4.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7"/><path d="M19.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 0-3-5.5"/></svg><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 19px; color: #163828">Tired of being a landlord</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4A564F">We can buy with tenants still in place.</p></div></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 26px 28px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F4D3A" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex: none"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M8 2v4"/><path d="M16 2v4"/></svg><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 19px; color: #163828">Moving or downsizing</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4A564F">Close when your next home is ready, not before.</p></div></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 26px 28px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F4D3A" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex: none"><path d="M12 3v18"/><path d="M5 8l7-5 7 5"/><path d="M5 8l-2 6h6z"/><path d="M19 8l-2 6h6z"/></svg><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 19px; color: #163828">Divorce or life change</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4A564F">A simple, private sale both sides can agree to.</p></div></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 26px 28px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F4D3A" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex: none"><path d="M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9z"/><path d="M14 3v6h6"/><path d="M9 14h6"/><path d="M9 17h4"/></svg><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 19px; color: #163828">Code issues or open permits</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4A564F">We take on the paperwork and the fixes.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- COMPARE -->
<section style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 104px 24px">
<div style="font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8A6A35; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px">Your options</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 40px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1.15; color: #163828">Selling to us, or listing with an agent</h2>
<div style="overflow-x: auto; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4DCCB; border-radius: 10px">
<table style="width: 100%; min-width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 17px">
<thead>
<tr style="text-align: left">
<th scope="col" style="padding: 20px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E4DCCB; color: #5A665F; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px"></th>
<th scope="col" style="padding: 20px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E4DCCB; background: #1F4D3A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600">Selling to us</th>
<th scope="col" style="padding: 20px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E4DCCB; color: #23302A; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600">Listing with an agent</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><th scope="row" style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8; text-align: left; font-weight: 600">Repairs</th><td style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8; background: #F3F7F4">None. We buy it as it is</td><td style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8">Often needed to sell or pass inspection</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8; text-align: left; font-weight: 600">Showings</th><td style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8; background: #F3F7F4">One visit</td><td style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8">Open houses and private showings</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8; text-align: left; font-weight: 600">Commissions</th><td style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8; background: #F3F7F4">None</td><td style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8">Usually paid by the seller</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8; text-align: left; font-weight: 600">Closing costs</th><td style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8; background: #F3F7F4">We walk you through every cost before you sign</td><td style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8">Usually split per the contract</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8; text-align: left; font-weight: 600">Financing risk</th><td style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8; background: #F3F7F4">Cash purchase, no lender approval</td><td style="padding: 18px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE8D8">Buyer's loan can fall through</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" style="padding: 18px 24px; text-align: left; font-weight: 600">Closing date</th><td style="padding: 18px 24px; background: #F3F7F4">You choose it</td><td style="padding: 18px 24px">Depends on the buyer and lender</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p style="margin: 20px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5A665F">Listing often brings a higher price, and for some homes it's the better choice. We'll tell you honestly if we think that's true for yours.</p>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about" style="background: #FFFFFF; border-top: 1px solid #E4DCCB; border-bottom: 1px solid #E4DCCB">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: center">
<figure style="flex: 1 1 360px; max-width: 480px; margin: 0">
<img src="/images/jim-olga.webp" width="503" height="468" loading="lazy" alt="Jim and Olga Blackburn at a home they are renovating" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 10px">
<figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #5A665F">Jim and Olga Blackburn · Fort Lauderdale, Florida</figcaption>
</figure>
<div style="flex: 1 1 480px; min-width: 0">
<div style="font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8A6A35; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px">About us</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1.15; color: #163828">You'll deal with us, not a call center.</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #4A564F">We're Jim and Olga Blackburn, a husband and wife who live and work in Fort Lauderdale. Blackburn Capital Partners brings together the capital and the investment partners to buy older homes, renovate them, and give them a second life in the neighborhood. Sometimes we buy on our own. Sometimes we buy alongside partners. Either way, you sign one contract with us.</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #4A564F">Jim has spent his career in home financing as a seven-time Scotsman Guide Top 1% mortgage producer. Olga is a licensed Florida real estate agent with The Keyes Company. Between us, we know what a house is worth and how to close on time.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #4A564F">When we make you an offer, we show you how we got there. If it isn't right for you, there's no pressure.</p>
</div>
</div>
